ink":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T22:07:43-07:00","id":888839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/888441-the-pack-is-here?p=888751#post888751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was expecting something in the vein of Flowers from Hell, Like 75% more word-count. It does leaves one pretty hungry for more content. Specially lodge-wise.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. It's kind of making me think of things like Invite Only, the small but very focused books. I think the first chapter could use more about the Pure, but also some other situations, like what they do when a pack member dies. The protectorate section was good but would have been better with more examples of protectorates. While having the advice and guidance is incredibly useful, it's a bonus when you're given plots, groups, locations and situations that you can drop into your game.<br /> <br /> It's up to Silver Best Seller now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cu