88844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/888441-the-pack-is-here?p=888835#post888835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, has anyone written up a freehold using Siskur-Dah as the Bulwark yet?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you do this to me.<br /> <br /> *adds that to the list of Freeholds to make*<br /> <br /> EDIT: For the record, this means I have an Incarnate/possibly a Brood based Freehold to make, and now a Siskur-Dah Freehold.<br /> <br /> Christ, why don't I just make a freehold for-NO. NO. NO.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Actually, this works out-I've been getting an itch to write a Mennina Lodge to make up for my lack of attention to them, and actually they would be really invested in the fight against the True Fae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-12-2016, 01:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T22:29:50-07:00","id"